+/**
+ * KubeCoder modern-app toolchain container: the image a full-stack KubeCoder environment runs
+ * as its tool sidecar (Node 24 with npm, corepack/pnpm and bun, the Playwright OS deps but no
+ * browser, poetry, ruff, uv, git).
+ * Runs as uid 1000, the agent's own user, so the checkout and whatever the container writes
+ * into the workspace share an owner (git refuses a repository another uid owns).
+ * The image points COREPACK_HOME and PNPM_HOME at KubeCoder home overlays an agent pod lacks;
+ * uid 1000 owns /home/ubuntu in the image, so corepack and pnpm create them there, empty on
+ * every build.
+ */
+def modern_app_toolchain(String name) {
+    return containerTemplate(name: name, image: 'registry:5000/kube-coder-modern-app-toolchain:node-24', command: 'sleep', args: 'infinity', alwaysPullImage: true, runAsUser: '1000')
+}
+
